  "topPRs": [
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM6y-zCT",
      "title": "feat: add rehearsal task for governance upgrade",
      "author": "0xniha",
      "number": 1289,
      "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis PR adds **Rehearsal 4: Governor Upgrade**, enabling the Security Council to practice upgrading the Optimism Governor contract through an L1 deposit.\r\n\r\n### Task Implementation\r\n\r\n- [Task](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/pull/1289/files#diff-9ab92e2a7d110692ff8ef2e8777e37d94ec13890db31484066a29f72d32293fb): Complete rehearsal task using the `L1PortalExecuteL2Call` template.\r\n- Implements governor upgrade execution via L1 deposit transaction.\r\n\r\n### Documentation\r\n\r\n- [Security Council Workflow](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/pull/1289/files#diff-d18244057e7295c78d6353138c857f7952a1435813835cd421086dc722cf12ef): Step-by-step guide for Security Council members to execute the rehearsal.\r\n- [L2 Simulation Guide](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/pull/1289/files#diff-eb55b8e65db3f4deeb5169d7163019d8b170392fa560dff9a8ec3b82a2596e99): Detailed walkthrough for manually simulating the L2 upgrade execution in Tenderly.\r\n  > **State Override Required**: The simulation requires setting `OptimismGovernorProxy` admin to `L2ProxyAdmin` via state override, because assumes this ownership to perform the upgrade.\r\n\r\n## Additional Changes\r\n\r\n- Fixed incorrect file paths in documentation references in [`README.md`](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops/pull/1289/files#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5).",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2025-11-12T13:19:55Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 371,
      "deletions": 5
    },
